'cause that's what I do.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.740
- Tell me more about yourself.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:51.652
Where were you born?

00:03:51.652 --> 00:03:53.315
- Myself? I was born in Philadelphia.

00:03:53.315 --> 00:03:54.148
- What part?

00:03:54.148 --> 00:03:55.410
- North. North Philly.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:56.885
